msgid "Disable shell integration (non-POSIX servers)"
msgstr "Disable shell integration (non-POSIX servers)"

msgid "Linux / macOS / BSD and other POSIX shells (bash, zsh, sh): leave UNCHECKED (off) — this enables SFTP directory-follow and live CPU / memory / disk / process monitoring.\nWindows (PowerShell / cmd), network gear (switches, routers, firewalls) and other non-POSIX shells: CHECK it (on) — these don't support the injection hooks, so leaving it unchecked would leak setup commands or garbled text into the terminal."
msgstr "Linux / macOS / BSD and other POSIX shells (bash, zsh, sh): leave UNCHECKED (off) — this enables SFTP directory-follow and live CPU / memory / disk / process monitoring.\nWindows (PowerShell / cmd), network gear (switches, routers, firewalls) and other non-POSIX shells: CHECK it (on) — these don't support the injection hooks, so leaving it unchecked would leak setup commands or garbled text into the terminal."

